  "hotelDescription": "Shipshape, Bristol fashion, and so much more... It\u0027s all on your doorstep at the Premier Inn Hotel Bristol City Centre King Street. Based in the historic harbourside, you can walk to most of the major attractions, transport links and nightlife. \n\nCatch a show at the Bristol Hippodrome or Old Vic Theatre. Let off some steam at Brunel\u0027s pioneering ship, the SS Great Britain. Let your hair down at the Jazz Festival, Harbourside Festival or Balloon Fiesta. Then return and recharge in our onsite pub and extra-comfy beds.",
  "hotelDirections": "M4(J19) take M32 into City Centre, keep following the signs into City Centre. Turn left onto B4053 Baldwin Street. Turn right into Queen Charlotte St, follow the road round, bear right at Welshback and right on Little King St. The hotel is on the right next to the Llandoger Trow. Sat nav BS1 4ER. NCP car parking is available on Queen Charlotte Street, with 25% discount.",
